@prefix ex: <https://example.org/> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

ex:car rdfs:comment "An electric automobile stores power in rechargeable batteries." .
ex:bread rdfs:comment "A recipe for baking bread with flour and yeast." .
ex:stars rdfs:comment "Distant galaxies contain stars and cosmic dust." .
